      "writtenOn": "2026-08-06T09:45:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we avoid silently mapping an invalid PowerState string to Always? A typo in the config would make the sensor start earlier than intended, which defeats the purpose of this change. A warning and safe fallback, or explicit validation failure, would be safer.",
      "revId": "46841e23c94cafc955c16916a31c55ca77686cab",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
